ages.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5da7d49f6a98d112691e4bbc/1588429104654-8ZNNIJCK7V04FQJTSP1B/Il+Cantinori+-+New+York+City?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5da7d49f6a98d112691e4bbc/1588429104654-8ZNNIJCK7V04FQJTSP1B/Il+Cantinori+-+New+York+City?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5da7d49f6a98d112691e4bbc/1588429104654-8ZNNIJCK7V04FQJTSP1B/Il+Cantinori+-+New+York+City?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-loader=\"sqs\">\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        \n            </button>\n          \n        \n\n        \n          \n          <figcaption data-sqsp-image-classic-block-caption-container class=\"image-caption-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"image-caption\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The best.</p></div>\n          </figcaption>\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    </div>\n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n</div></div></div><div class=\"col sqs-col-2 span-2\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-spacer spacer-block sized vsize-1\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/3399b973-9dd2-4804-8498-7f08111b52b6_1297/website.components.spacer.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/3399b973-9dd2-4804-8498-7f08111b52b6_1297/website.components.spacer.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.spacer\" data-website-component-id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1588431086566_15822\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1588431086566_15822\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1588424934690_20612\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A wee bit of history: Jackie and I met while bartending on the Upper East Side, but then we ended up side by side (literally, sat next to each other) as Executive Assistants at AOL.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">#startedfromthebottomnowwealittlebitabovethebottom</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">I supported the CEO and Jackie supported the CPO. The work was hard, the hours were long, but the friendships made it all worth the ride. SO. When the menu would arrive we would AG. ON. IZE. Over what to order and we typically would always settle upon splitting TWO pastas (#fat). Sometimes we’d try the bucatini. Sometimes the bolognese. Sometimes the spaghetti amatriciana.&nbsp;But ALWAYS. ALWAYS, without question, we would order the pappardelle alla buttera.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block image-block sqs-block-image\" data-block-type=\"5\" data-sqsp-block=\"image-classic\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1588424934690_21313\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    <div\n        class=\"\n          image-block-outer-wrapper\n          layout-caption-below\n          design-layout-inline\n          combination-animation-none\n          individual-animation-none\n          individual-text-animation-none\n        \"\n        data-test=\"image-block-inline-outer-wrapper\"\n        data-sqsp-image-classic-block-layout=\"inline\"\n    >\n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure\n            class=\"\n              sqs-block-image-figure\n              intrinsic\n            \"\n            style=\"max-width:719px;\"\n        >\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            <button\n                data-sqsp-image-classic-block-lightbox-button\n                class=\"\n                  sqs-b